      "body": "First step is to have c2go work with all the options disabled. Then we can integrate csmith with travis and slowly enable options as the functionalities are implemented.\r\n\r\nhttp://embed.cs.utah.edu/csmith/\r\n\r\n```\r\ncsmith -o main.c \\\r\n--no-argc \\\r\n--no-arrays \\\r\n--no-bitfields \\\r\n--no-checksum \\\r\n--no-comma-operators \\\r\n--no-compound-assignment \\\r\n--no-consts \\\r\n--divs \\\r\n--no-embedded-assigns \\\r\n--no-pre-incr-operator \\\r\n--no-pre-decr-operator \\\r\n--no-post-incr-operator \\\r\n--no-post-decr-operator \\\r\n--no-unary-plus-operator \\\r\n--no-jumps \\\r\n--longlong \\\r\n--float \\\r\n--main \\\r\n--no-math64 \\\r\n--no-inline-function \\\r\n--max-array-dim 1 \\\r\n--max-pointer-depth 1 \\\r\n--no-safe-math \\\r\n--no-packed-struct \\\r\n--no-unions \\\r\n--no-volatiles \\\r\n--no-volatile-pointers \\\r\n--no-const-pointers \\\r\n--no-builtins \\\r\n--max-nested-struct-level 0 \\\r\n--no-dangling-global-pointers \\\r\n--no-return-dead-pointer \\\r\n--max-struct-nested-level 1 \\\r\n--strict-float \\\r\n--no-int8 \\\r\n--no-uint8\r\n```\r\n\r\nC_INCLUDE_PATH=$CSMITH_PATH/csmith-2.3.0/runtime/ c2go transpile main.c\r\n",
